{"seq":1,"slug":"white-balance-correction","title":"白平衡校正与色温还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/white-balance-correction","wordCount":1867,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"白平衡校正与色温还原\">白平衡校正与色温还原</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>白平衡校正围绕&quot;让中性色真正中性&quot;展开，其要点彼此关联：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>目标：中性灰还原</strong>：消除光源色温造成的色彩偏移，使画面中本应中性的区域 RGB 三通道数值相等。</li>\n<li><strong>双轴模型</strong>：色温轴（蓝↔黄）补偿光源 CCT，色调轴（绿↔品红）补偿光源光谱偏差，二者相互独立。</li>\n<li><strong>通道增益本质</strong>：校正等价于对 R/G/B 施加不同增益系数；光源偏暖（低色温）时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_B &gt; G_R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>阶段决定损失</strong>：RAW 解码时校正无损，Log 后期极微，Rec.709 后期存在可见的量化损失与灵活性下降。</li>\n<li><strong>混合光源约束</strong>：单一全局白平衡无法统一多色温场景，需借助 Power Window/Qualifier 局部校正，或刻意保留色温差。</li>\n<li><strong>客观标定</strong>：色卡（如 X-Rite ColorChecker）提供可量化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的白平衡参考基准。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"白平衡校正的目标与原理\">白平衡校正的目标与原理</h2><p>白平衡校正是一次校正（Primary Correction）的首要步骤。其目标是消除光源色温对画面的色彩偏移影响，使中性灰在画面中呈现为真正的无色彩倾向灰——即 RGB 三通道数值相等的状态。</p>\n<p>人眼具有强大的色彩恒常性（Chromatic Adaptation），能在不同色温光源下自动&quot;脑补&quot;白色。但摄影传感器缺乏这种适应能力，在钨丝灯（约 3200K）下拍摄的画面呈现暖黄偏移，在阴天（约 7000K）下拍摄则呈现冷蓝偏移。白平衡校正的本质是对 RGB 三通道施加不同的增益系数，补偿光源色温造成的偏差。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;白平衡校正流程&quot;&#10;        RAW[RAW/Log 素材] --&gt; ANALYZE[分析灰点/白点]&#10;        ANALYZE --&gt; CALC[计算 RGB 增益系数]&#10;        CALC --&gt; APPLY[应用通道增益]&#10;        APPLY --&gt; NEUTRAL[中性灰还原]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;色温参考&quot;&#10;        T1[&quot;烛光 1800K&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;钨丝灯 3200K&quot;]&#10;        T3[&quot;日光 5600K&quot;]&#10;        T4[&quot;阴天 7000K&quot;]&#10;        T5[&quot;蓝天 12000K&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"白平衡校正流程\"\n        RAW[RAW/Log 素材] --&gt; ANALYZE[分析灰点/白点]\n        ANALYZE --&gt; CALC[计算 RGB 增益系数]\n        CALC --&gt; APPLY[应用通道增益]\n        APPLY --&gt; NEUTRAL[中性灰还原]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"色温参考\"\n        T1[\"烛光 1800K\"]\n        T2[\"钨丝灯 3200K\"]\n        T3[\"日光 5600K\"]\n        T4[\"阴天 7000K\"]\n        T5[\"蓝天 12000K\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"色温与色调的双轴模型\">色温与色调的双轴模型</h3><p>白平衡校正涉及两个独立维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>轴向</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n<th>控制参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>色温 (Temperature)</td>\n<td>蓝 ↔ 黄</td>\n<td>光源 CCT 补偿</td>\n<td>Kelvin 值 / Temperature 滑块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调 (Tint)</td>\n<td>绿 ↔ 品红</td>\n<td>光源光谱偏差补偿</td>\n<td>Green-Magenta 滑块</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>白平衡校正</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{白平衡校正} = \\begin{pmatrix} G_R &amp; 0 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; G_G &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 &amp; G_B \\end{pmatrix} \\times \\begin{pmatrix} R_{raw} \\\\ G_{raw} \\\\ B_{raw} \\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">白平衡校正</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5